":3329461120,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gc4uA","user":{"login":"zorbathut","id":160754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut","html_url":"https://github.com/zorbathut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T15:32:29Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T15:32:29Z","body":"> Pretty excited to see this - how will this be handled in conjunction with #110441?\r\n\r\nIt's basically the same thing as #110441, plus Mac support, plus a few minor features that I personally think shouldn't be included but overall don't care. I am happy for the core team to pick whichever they prefer as long as one of them makes it into 4.6 (ideally sooner rather than later so I can also get proper C#-within-C# support on top of it :V)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329461120/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329881640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110863#issuecomment-3329881640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110863","id":3329881640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GefYo","user":{"login":"EricApostal","id":60072374,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcyMzc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60072374?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal","html_url":"https://github.com/EricApostal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricApostal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T17:01:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T17:01:56Z","body":"To @fire's point in this PR alongside #110441 - I see a lot of issues with the name `libgodot`, reason being that the `lib` prefix is a very strong convention in Android. When loading native libraries, Android will automatically bundle `lib`- prefixed libraries (in the folder for the target ABI), thus some binary otherwise named `godot` would in this instance be `libgodot.so`.\r\n\r\nWhat about something like `GDEmbedded` or `GodotEmbedded`? I don't completely hate `embedded`, but that feels too generic.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329881640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329955715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110863#issuecomment-3329955715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110863","id":3329955715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GexeD","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T17:25:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T17:25:16Z","body":"We should discuss if we want to call this \"libgodot\", however:\r\n\r\n> What about something like `GDEmbedded` or `GodotEmbedded`? I don't completely hate `embedded`, but that feels too generic.\r\n\r\nI'm not crazy about \"embedded\". That name is generic enough that it could conflict with some completely unrelated thing we want to call \"embedded\" in the future.\r\n\r\nWhat I like about \"libgodot\" is that it is very specific, and sounds kind of like a product/feature name, so it seems unlikely to conflict with something else in the future. It may be the best option we've come up with so far.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329955715/reactions","total_coun